**You can:**
- Fork this repo and learn from the code
- Use the code (MIT) in your own commercial projects
- Adapt the design concept for non-commercial purposes (CC BY-NC-SA)
- Reference this work in your own writing or portfolio

**You should not:**
- Use the design concept commercially without explicit permission
- Claim authorship of the original concept
- Remove the disclosure banner if redeploying

**You must:**
- Credit Awack Studio if you adapt the design
- Keep this license file in any forks or derivatives
